  "title": "Savory Slow Cooker Beef Tips",
  "description": "Mix together a few things including soup, mushrooms, and a cup of ginger ale in a slow cooker, and you'll have a delicious dinner of beef tips and gravy in 6 hours. Serve over hot cooked rice.",
  "authors": [
